&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an &lt;strong&gt;Electrical Engineering Intern&lt;/strong&gt; to support the design and test of critical hardware components during&lt;strong&gt; Fall 2026.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
