&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Helix AI Engineer, Robot Learning&lt;/strong&gt; with a strong robotics learning background to help develop and improve our &lt;strong&gt;visuomotor manipulation policies&lt;/strong&gt;, with a heavy emphasis on &lt;strong&gt;real-robot deployment&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
