&lt;li&gt;Experience with Altium.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CAD experience (EPLAN, Solidworks Electrical, CATIA, etc)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embedded programming of DSPs, microcontrollers, and FPGAs.&lt;/li&gt;
