&lt;p class=&quot;_10dfkk10&quot;&gt;Figure is an AI robotics company building general-purpose humanoid robots with human-level intelligence. Our robots are engineered to perform a wide range of tasks in commercial and industrial environments. We are based in San Jose, CA and require 5 days/week in-office collaboration. It&#39;s time to build.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Mechanical Engineer to own softgoods and plastic parts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
