&lt;li&gt;Own the industrial design robot buck, keep up to date with latest files from our engineers and communicate with suppliers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design injection molded plastic parts with Class A surfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate accurate 2D drawings using GD&amp;amp;T per ASME Y14.5.&lt;/li&gt;
