&lt;li&gt;Expert in using 3D CAD software to design parts with complex geometry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with high volume manufacturing processes specifically injection molding and die cutting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and building prototypes&lt;/li&gt;
