&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in a fast-paced, hands-on environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to stand and move for 8+ hours per shift&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reliable, proactive, and composed under time pressure&lt;/li&gt;
