&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in a fast-paced environment with shifting priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communicator&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bonus Qualifications:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
