&lt;li&gt;IPC certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience building robotic systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience 3D CAD modeling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with 3D printing, machining, or other in house fabrication&lt;/li&gt;
