&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–5 years of experience in a Manufacturing Quality Control environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with root cause analysis and CAPA methodologies (8D, 5-Why, fishbone/Ishikawa)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read and interpret engineering drawings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to use basic measurement tools such as pin gauges, bore gauges, calipers, and micrometers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Microsoft Office or Google Suite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
