&lt;li&gt;Forklift certification or experience with equipment handling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in film/TV production, photography sets, or real estate staging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a contract position with potential to convert to full time, based on performance and business needs. The US base hourly range for this contract position is $28 - $38/hr.&lt;/p&gt;
