&lt;li&gt;Proven experience with process validation, root cause analysis, and continuous improvement methodologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review supplier process plan and drive improvements before start of production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert at GD&amp;amp;T&lt;/li&gt;
