&lt;li&gt;Develop the security &amp;amp; privacy program at Figure, and work with teams across the company to implement necessary controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure that security, privacy and data protection principles are seamlessly integrated into Figure’s products, services, and operations, while aligning with organizational goals and regulatory requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and enforce data governance policies and frameworks to ensure data integrity, security, and compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review security &amp;amp; privacy requirements for relevant industry standards and support certification efforts, including SOC, NIST, ISO, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
